Patch summary:
Teach the Goldfish sensors transport interface about split CONTROL and DATA
message paths so Cuttlefish's separate sensors vconsoles can compile and route
traffic correctly, while Ranchu/qemud keeps using its existing single fd.

Also read the DATA message before taking m_mtx: a blocked read inside the lock
stalled activate() and SensorService init, so the guest never finished booting
after a restart.

